00:03:11.177 --> 00:03:13.180
And then the server is where our kid of

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:16.840
custom code is to run
computations to either make a plot

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.380
or make some sort of visualization

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:23.380
or produce some sort
of output (indistinct)

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.460
and that's all gonna be server.

